  "details": "This is a very very minor detail, but the padding around names in the Friends wing of the QM seems very inconsistent. It's not happening 100% of the time, but I do notice when it does happen, it seems to be affecting some friends more than others. I've only noticed it in current instances, but that may be due to most of my friends being on Orange and not showing up in one big list til I'm there.\nIt's hard to tell in the \"Friends in Private Instances\" area because there is already a lot of padding around them.\n(Obscured my friends' names for their privacy, plus they had contact info in their statuses)",
